# To Find smb.conf from /etc/samba3

## smb.conf (optional)

Symbolic link to [/usr/local/samba/lib/smb.conf](../../usr/local/samba/lib/smb.conf).
This link make it easy to find smb.conf read by
Samba suites under /usr/local/samba.

```bash
sudo ln -s ../../usr/local/samba/lib/smb.conf
```

The Samba suite built with prefix /usr/local/samba
read configuration file
[/usr/local/samba/lib/smb.conf](../../usr/local/samba/lib/smb.conf).
They know absolute path to /usr/local/samba/lib/smb.conf.
